# Normalise all text files to LF in the repo and in working trees.
# Changesets release merges on Windows machines had reintroduced CRLF into the
# generated CHANGELOG.md and package.json files, which fails `pnpm format:check`
# because Prettier defaults to `endOfLine: 'lf'`. With `* text=auto eol=lf`,
# git detects text files and keeps them LF regardless of a contributor's
# `core.autocrlf` setting.
* text=auto eol=lf
